{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "46c740f366cc7723d0d22a8943aa4f89698c014d4cbdef8a204af7f44f6cc25d", "ja": "いいえ！　これはまこりんから借りた単行本で、\nこっちがまつりちゃんから借りた『りるきゃん』だよ！", "zh": "不是！这本是从真那里借来的单行本，这边这本是从茉莉那里借来的《りるきゃん》哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e18e52a1b70422a8cb53f011fff89b572853bdc2092661770372d3b25e67c689", "ja": "あっ、『キミさけ』だ～！　これ最新刊？\nわたし、まだ読んでない～！", "zh": "啊，《キミさけ》！这是最新一卷吗？\n我还没看呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "62c9e26ee8f6d8ec90dae0a56af342adf025b311762a2b5118bf21e3ce5ca107", "ja": "こ、この間、発売されたばかりだもんね……。\n私も、続き……き、気になってたんだ……♪", "zh": "因、因为前几天才刚发售嘛……我也、也一直很在意后续内容呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1011_null", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "bff0077222f8558a9aa4a0b83836646afd55bef64ef52edfdcbc0831630b47a6", "ja": "おっ、やっぱり……！\nみんな、こんなところにいたのか。", "zh": "哦，果然……！\n大家原来都在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "811d205e8bf11d5931e146b0ec27df32dcf1a40d6dd970c3d9c9f8981281ad60", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nおはようございま～す♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n早安～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "55fe267f3cf47587f0d78f7f782b913ac27b548bf831a6c988fe49e823b072de", "ja": "？　『りるきゃん』と、少女マンガの単行本が\nたくさん……？", "zh": "？《りるきゃん》和好多少女漫画的单行本……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3c2290c029721b49c083bbe1c4f4c76ff9b07ccaa0deef23494f9c4170508214", "ja": "あっ、そうか。みんなで、ステージのアイディアを\n考えるためにマンガを読んでたのか？　研究熱心だな！", "zh": "啊，原来如此。大家是为了集思广益想舞台的点子，才一起看漫画的吗？真是热衷研究啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "821ceabcb0dde86cb9ce9691ae2129e45b33215326417efb402d5fa3f729f7a7", "ja": "違いますよ～。", "zh": "不是哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "f1db984e306b7309e072e3ba77a146948d82ba94582b26dc67e23537b897f913", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん！\n茜ちゃんたちは！　マンガを描く事にした！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n小茜我们！决定画漫画了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bb5baa8d983c736718707fabcae459a0a219fd8cc19572a5f3d003b219bb3c9d", "ja": "えっ……なんて？", "zh": "诶……你说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "473239446fdb351d3f4a3e14e9f97ddab40043f68c2209b957c96f3b71486b58", "ja": "言葉のとおりだよ！　イベントの『持ち込み編集部』に\n出すために、3人でマンガを描く事に決めたのだ！", "zh": "就是字面意思！我们决定3个人一起画漫画，投稿到活动的\"自带稿件编辑部\"！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "34fdd984be36f3a359334fa48f738662b13297e306fa7f964e9a3e0276eb85f9", "ja": "いや、マンガを描くって……本気か？", "zh": "不是吧，要画漫画……你是认真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "ee57862cbd501c648309a86bbda23d79be321532c8a6db8120a0352e5d83f058", "ja": "だって、入賞したら賞金500万円だよ！？\nやるっきゃないでしょ！", "zh": "因为获奖的话，可是有奖金500万日元哦！？  \n不做才怪吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "50123211f456309e28a76cf38f4484bcb2000bcd71cfda07bc60cc10ea2b4601", "ja": "500万ってすごいですよね～！\nわたしも、もらえたらうれしいな～って♪", "zh": "500万好厉害呀～！\n要是我也能拿到的话，会好开心的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "4d917c22bdebe926f0ee3a1365cb3455ecbaaaaeb5ecda4013514cdb2985849d", "ja": "まあ、たしかに大金だけど……。", "zh": "嗯，确实是一笔巨款呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "859e8e9d78596263c78bc76f0bb4e7992ce91c4df35bf3f0b18db307a0bfcc89", "ja": "でね、茜ちゃんは色々調べたのだ！\n500ま、いや、賞を確実に獲るための方法を！", "zh": "然后啊，小茜我可是调查了各种各样的事情！500嘛，不对，是确保拿到奖项的方法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5e11df69332d207cb5f5a5df4bc5226a7ce3af0592a3c5b42752ae3b4e2a551e", "ja": "マンガを描くには、絵も大事だけど。\nまずは、お話を考えないとなんですって！", "zh": "要画漫画，画工很重要，但是首先得构思故事才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "c1bcf5309113971e6c397372c753808035532966877fca206590673d49fc0472", "ja": "そ、それで、のり子さんと、亜利沙ちゃんと、\n麗花さんに……あ、アドバイスをもらって……。", "zh": "所、所以，我向德莉子小姐、亚利沙，还有丽花小姐……请、请教了一些建议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "1b48c07e8d1ba043d37e88a787a13a9eed26c284b99d7c574824a1b5b436302b", "ja": "あ……なるほど。『紙・心・ペン・心』の\nメンバーに話を聞いてきたのか。", "zh": "啊……原来如此。你去向《纸・心・笔・心》的成员请教过了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "b107c3b813035c8cfc7656948f1258a9362e5966ceaf5d4a895948d2de680f23", "ja": "あの作品には、千早と紗代子も出てるけど……\nマンガを描いている役は、その3人だったもんな。", "zh": "千早和纱代子虽然也有在那部作品里登场……\n不过扮演画漫画的角色的，确实是那3个人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "11534763a435b4910ca0960dd458f30b3ec465e33b332ea1d6c663b4fd4f00e0", "ja": "はい……。ま、マンガを描くために、\nいろいろ、意見を聞きたいなって……。", "zh": "是的……我就是想为了画漫画，听听大家的各种意见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "d2cecb80e736e0c42835f1762ac85d37c974283b3e784e219fe26b271528d511", "ja": "たしかにそのメンバーなら、\n参考になる意見が聞けるだろうけど……。", "zh": "确实，要是那些成员的话，应该能听到有参考价值的意见吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "2695568fa5d2153f605512374fe68a62e08dd1fa622af7a30a866040e743b443", "ja": "まあ、まだイベントまで余裕もあるし、いいか……。\nひとまず、みんなのやりたい事をやってみてくれ。", "zh": "嗯，离活动还有一段时间，就这样吧……\n总之，先试着做做大家想做的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "ece9f4061ceb7e2840ac6bed8fefc91dd870f2950b4c1ce5a144711a490e1150", "ja": "さすが{$P$}ちゃん、話がわかる～♪\n500ま、じゃなくて、賞を目指して頑張るね！", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}，真懂行～♪  \n不是冲着500万，而是要以奖项为目标努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1033_023aka", "source_sha256": "28288ae0caa897788ddd7cf87ae7afa4a6cf4f8c5ed5b6675f067bdcea9cb5db", "ja": "それじゃあ、みんな！\nマンガを描くために、まずはお話を作るよ！", "zh": "那么，各位！\n为了画漫画，首先要编个故事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1034_045kar", "source_sha256": "1a4885e3cae2cd8b83d2611b5b17f48345d9175a9580922d3a1ee88382d2e7d4", "ja": "お、お話……。そう言われても……。\nど、どうやって作れば、いいのかな……？", "zh": "故、故事……。就算这么说……  \n该、该怎么编才好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "a9884d97dc763e1345ff88a607988a2d18b0f4125f12367dec949d6ad10e0e2b", "ja": "最初はプロットという、物語の\nあらすじのようなものを作るんじゃないかな。", "zh": "首先应该要写一个叫做大纲的东西，\n就像是故事梗概之类的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1036_045kar", "source_sha256": "ec800ace691dc66841c9a56aee610c352d9e11d85f348eff53580064ace549ed", "ja": "そ、そうなんですね……。\nあらすじ……。うーん……む、難しい……。", "zh": "是、是这样啊……。\n故事梗概……嗯……好、好难……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1037_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4d2ae72b2d712efebdb7eb7eb66cdc239958ce8569b1b433cc4030c921918209", "ja": "ん～……だったら、自分たちの理想の少女マンガを\n考えたらいいんじゃないですか？", "zh": "嗯～……既然这样，那就想想自己理想中的少女漫画，不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1038_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f40fa9d4ed34a338283d4ecb640247412827071db4f7e49b8dd00d41fa6b30a2", "ja": "どんな感じが理想なのかがわかれば、\nお話ができるかも？", "zh": "如果能知道理想的感觉，说不定就能创作出故事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1039_023aka", "source_sha256": "3b2ca8e4c67ed7a26c9c172ac664d2e96c34b7b6b859665de6b18acdd4e1a24c", "ja": "おっ、いいね翼ちゃん、流石だね！\nそこから、想像を膨らませてみよう！", "zh": "哦，不错嘛，翼，真不愧是你！\n就从那里展开想象吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1040_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c95a5fdd599771dd1bf0cc6af3949b4c81a9f321aec07535df6aa4349d0f22c0", "ja": "じゃあ、わたしから発表しま～す！\nわたしの理想は～、モテモテハッピーライフで～す♪", "zh": "那么，就由我来发表吧～！\n我的理想是——受欢迎的幸福生活～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1041_045kar", "source_sha256": "702a4f7bbea2954df7a33309734c7bd766f3f83a28947398054abff9401157e3", "ja": "も、モテモテ、ハッピーライフ……？", "zh": "受、受人欢迎，幸福生活……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1042_016tsu", "source_sha256": "eae34afcb609e6467f2c3c7c90a4ad3a7788ee30426da3dcb9b6cb53e819a833", "ja": "主人公がモテモテの女の子で、\n好きな人とも超ラブラブで、とにかくハッピーなお話！", "zh": "主角是个备受欢迎的女孩子，\n和喜欢的人也超级恩爱，总之就是一个幸福满满的故事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1043_023aka", "source_sha256": "61b647035fa760b410fc4cec330e3805a0d6a78c519ffac0c820cae16c84e045", "ja": "うんうん！　そういう甘々な少女漫画もいいよね！\n茜ちゃんは、ウハウハハッピーライフかな～？", "zh": "嗯嗯！那种甜甜的少女漫画也很不错呢！\n小茜的生活，会是欢天喜地的幸福生活吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1044_045kar", "source_sha256": "540bfa613751ab1c4c6855d98ed2ce826cdfee5ed1c354832462e0b97f16d276", "ja": "う、ウハウハ……？", "zh": "美、美滋滋……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1045_023aka", "source_sha256": "bc816dbe73f69eab6c0a8f7af5252f7e9de51ae492834bd29dde6b9d70ea7438", "ja": "恋を手に入れるだけではなく、富と名声も手に入れる！\nウハウハハッピーライフのことだよ、可憐ちゃん！", "zh": "不仅收获了爱情，还能收获财富与名声！\n就是说美滋滋的幸福生活啦，可怜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1046_p", "source_sha256": "1927910fe3e8f4fc29b5f871d44e9ac576d08cfd46fd998cd6660d1b7506cefe", "ja": "それは、少女漫画じゃないんじゃないか？\nジャンル的に。", "zh": "从类型上来说，那应该不算少女漫画吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1047_023aka", "source_sha256": "2342c8abf242cfc77b2870f6752f8ad2ebc532117d56cbf525ef90c50fa55db1", "ja": "おや？　そ、そうかなー？\n茜ちゃん、恋愛にはお金も大事だと思うけどなー？", "zh": "咦？是、是这样吗——？\n小茜，我觉得谈恋爱钱也是很重要的嘛——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1048_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d190a4f45c365d11a3d6322e828147a2fb1e085b6857d1ccf536031f0aa452fd", "ja": "そうだよね！　茜ちゃん、いいこと言う～♪\nだってお金がなかったら、デートもできないし！", "zh": "说得对！小茜，你说得真好～♪ 毕竟没钱的话，连约会都去不了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1049_p", "source_sha256": "a338c604c44c3fdd5826112bcd7755acf6a72f7f2dc57e7fe5388f4bf160729b", "ja": "ふたりの意見はわかった。\nそれで、可憐はどんなのが理想なんだ？", "zh": "我明白你们两个人的意见了。\n那么，可怜理想中的约会是什么样的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1050_045kar", "source_sha256": "b7fc0d850a943465569dda4460a0ef94e48d4aff54e8ccf5ede27a3690bd3908", "ja": "わ、私、ですか……？\nえっと……。", "zh": "我、我吗……？\n那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1051_045kar", "source_sha256": "80db300c40dc0982d633e9096b4f666c232aefd0c1cf7620fc9070057a2e226a", "ja": "ひ、密かに片想いしていた相手に、勇気を出して、\n告白して……。お、OKをもらう、とか……？", "zh": "鼓、鼓起勇气向一直暗恋的对象……\n告白……然后、然后得到对方的答复……之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1052_023aka", "source_sha256": "1098f9066ea747ec0e9d256229310e552c66ebaca6f10cd82832e3acc1b41521", "ja": "清い……！\n清すぎるよ、可憐ちゃん……！", "zh": "太纯洁了……！\n纯洁过头了吧，可怜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1053_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a9a8a6fed31dc5f71af62a49e6c17c41b2410e60bb797fe50a5057013aa12c06", "ja": "可憐さん、モテモテじゃなくていいの？　みんなに\nチヤホヤされたり、プレゼントとかいらないのー！？", "zh": "可怜小姐，不受欢迎也没关系吗？就不想被大家\n捧在手心里、收很多礼物什么的吗——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1054_045kar", "source_sha256": "270fd5c52e480e754fd5c9494c1ece1ccb319600e911709362a4cfe47a4d13e3", "ja": "え？　う、うん。物は、いらないかな……？\n必要なものは、両親に買ってもらえるし……。", "zh": "诶？　嗯、嗯。不需要什么东西吧……？\n需要的东西，父母会买给我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_02_1055_p", "source_sha256": "31b271343b02d31b409e45ca590f269e2a9570239589d54a9ec40896725722aa", "ja": "（うーん、なかなかまとまらないな……。まあ、\nまだ時間はあるし、しばらく様子を見守るか……）", "zh": "（嗯——进展得不太顺利啊……不过嘛，还有时间，暂时先观察一下吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
